{% doc %}
  Card copy written for each product: short title, one line and two
  features, each taken from that product's own description, tags or photo.
  Read by snippets/cv-showcase-card.liquid on the home showcase and on
  collection pages, so a product's card says the same thing everywhere.
  Copy typed on a home showcase block still wins over this file.

  Outputs "title~|~line~|~icon 1~|~feature 1~|~icon 2~|~feature 2", or
  nothing for a product not listed here (its card then reads its copy off
  the product). Icons are names from snippets/cv-icon.liquid.

  @param {string} handle - Product handle.
{% enddoc %}
